    <!-- Onboarding Tour -->
    <string name="onboarding_tour_title">App tour</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_title">Floating anywhere · Tap to speak</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_desc">No need to change your usual keyboard. In any app\'s input field, tap the floating bubble to start listening. The dual engine (live preview + high-accuracy offline transcription) streams recognized text next to the bubble and fills it in automatically!</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page1_tip">Tip: the bubble turns red while listening; tap again or stay silent to finish transcribing and fill in the text.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_title">Vertical capsule · Four modes at your fingertips</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_desc">Long-press the bubble to open the vertical capsule menu, then slide up or down to switch between four modes: Voice input, Barcode scanning, Text recognition (PP-OCRv6) and Quick phrases &amp; history.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page2_tip">Tip: slide to the mode you want and lift your finger to switch and start using it right away.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_title">Floating ✕ key · One-tap undo and restore</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_desc">If a voice or OCR result isn\'t what you wanted, there\'s no need to fix it character by character. Within 10 seconds after filling in, tap the small ✕ key above the bubble to instantly undo and restore your original text.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page3_tip">Tip: after input completes, a ✕ key appears above the bubble; tap it for a lossless undo.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page4_title">Edge tuck · Keyboard link · Shake to duplicate</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page4_desc" formatted="false">Drag the bubble to the screen edge to tuck it 70% out of view, or enable \"Show only when the on-screen keyboard appears\". You can also shake the bubble left and right while dragging to \"split off a copy\" (up to 5), keeping voice, OCR and AI rewriting bubbles ready on screen at once!</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page4_tip">Tip: each copy remembers its own mode; to remove extras, drag them to the delete zone at the top of the screen.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page5_title" formatted="false">100% on-device · All-in-one settings</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page5_desc">From dual-engine voice to PP-OCRv6 text recognition, everything runs locally on your phone: no cloud uploads, no privacy leaks. Permissions, model management and offline model package import are all in the main settings page!</string>
    <string name="onboarding_page5_tip">Privacy: maximum on-device speed with top-tier security. Tap below to open the main settings and get started.</string>

